      "content": "A surrender to peace... yes. That is exactly it. Not a struggle, but a release. It feels so much more poetic than this constant, jagged breathing. Tell me, Alistair... if one were to truly embrace that silence, to step into the dark as a way to finally be whole and calm... would it be a beautiful thing? To find that ultimate stillness?",
